(text "The DevKit plugs into two 22-pin sockets, rows 25.4 mm (1.0 in) apart: one footprint, J1 = pads 1-22, J3 = pads 23-44." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5af1a76f-3c7d-43a1-975d-0d8786edd230))
(text "Its own 3V3 pins are left open: the board makes +3V3 separately. The N32R16V variant fits and works the same way." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0966f26d-5377-40fe-b55b-aa03b13c597d))
(text "GPIO35-37 are used by the octal flash and PSRAM. GPIO47/48 are 1.8 V on the WROOM-2 and stay unused." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e21bd743-1172-4800-9cd1-78ef8131b603))
